<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/> a skos:ConceptScheme,
        dcat:Catalog,
        bblocks:BBlocksRegister ;
    rdfs:label "Building Blocks - Generic Process Profiles" ;
    dct:abstract """A general-purpose, provider-independent vocabulary of process Concepts, Generic Profiles and
Implementation Profiles, the first three tiers of OGC 14-065 WPS 2.0.2 §7.5, independent of any
one project. The tiers differ in what they may carry: a Process Concept documents a general group
of processes, with no input or output; a Generic Profile gives one or more related operations an
abstract I/O signature (named roles, `dataType` concepts, multiplicity; no format, no size limit),
e.g. every binary boolean spatial predicate (Intersects, Contains, Within, Touches, Crosses,
Equals, Disjoint) takes two geometry inputs and returns one boolean, and is one Generic Profile,
not seven; an Implementation Profile refines one Generic Profile with the exchange formats it
supports, for any provider to implement. Real deployed or deployable processes, the fourth tier,
are not part of this register; they live wherever the implementation itself is profiled (e.g.
`ospd.process-profiles.*` for OSPD's CWL- and OGC-API-Processes-sourced profiles) and link back
here via their own `implementsProfile` property.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:description """Produced by GeoLabs, first grounded in the spatial predicates and set operations of OGC Simple
Feature Access - Common Architecture (06-103r4) as a worked example: they share a small number of
I/O shapes, so the Generic Profile layer stays small. SQL/MM Spatial (ISO/IEC 13249-3) binds the
same operations to SQL (the `ST_Geometry` type, `ST_Intersects`-style function names) and is
profiled here, at the Implementation Profile tier; real deployed processes bind them further
still (e.g. to GML 3.1.0 Polygon) and are profiled in whichever register profiles the concrete
process (e.g. `ospd.process-profiles.*`), linked back here by `implementsProfile`.
Not limited to spatial operations -- any domain with standardised abstract operations and several
independent bindings is a candidate.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:license [ rdfs:label "Apache-2.0" ] ;
    dct:modified "2026-11-12T14:59:40.509813"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    owl:imports <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-formats/build/register.json>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-data-types/build/register.json>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-ogcapi-processes/build/register.json>,
        <https://ogcincubator.github.io/activity-type-register/build/register.json>,
        <https://ogcincubator.github.io/registered-item-model/build/register.json>,
        <https://opengeospatial.github.io/bblocks/register.json> ;
    skos:hasTopConcept <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.analytical-hillshading>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.area>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.band-retrieval>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.buffer>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.centroid>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.contains>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.convex-hull>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.crosses>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.difference>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.disjoint>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.equals>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.geometry-extent>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.intersection>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.intersects>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.is-simple>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.otsu-thresholding>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.point-cloud-thinning>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.point-cloud-to-grid>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.point-cloud-to-shapes>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.product-selection>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.radiometric-index>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.raster-band-math>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.raster-band-math-multiband>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.raster-crop>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.raster-extent>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.raster-format-conversion>,
        <bblocks://generic-profiles.activity-type.raster-rendering>,
